$\min \sum_{i \in \{\text{MA}, \text{MB}, \text{MC}, \text{MD}, \text{ME}, \text{MF}\}} \sum_{j \in \{\text{P1}, \text{P2}, \text{P3}, \text{P4}, \text{P5}, \text{P6}\}} c_{ij} x_{ij}$

